<title>GERMANY: Buderus 5-mo pretax profit up 46 pct.</title>
<headline>Buderus 5-mo pretax profit up 46 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering group Buderus AG said on Wednesday its group pre-tax profit rose by 46 percent to 68 million marks in the first five months of its 1996/1997 business year and predicted sales and earnings for the full year would also rise.</p>
</text>
